  "bodyHash": "44d013da9b800f45",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">+100</span> МЕБЕЛЬ И БЛОКИ</strong></h1>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">Эти моды добавляют декор для экстерьера и интерьера, новые блоки, новые двери, ковры с узорами и многое другое</h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;сохраняя кубический дух ванильного Minecraft.</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Это обновление модов <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Jammy Furniture</span>, <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Extended Decoration</span> и <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Rug Mods</span> для Minecraft 1.4.7</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bfipmAWpbQQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️Для работы этих модов требуются зависимости, TCTCore ⚠️</strong></pre>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1064329/description_3fbde43e-996c-4363-83ce-ed278caf2d56.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"194\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ссылка для скачивания</a></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/bVUWqn7RPZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/bVUWqn7RPZ</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_28438a26-da9d-4260-817f-c0b2f13335e9.png\" width=\"815\" height=\"428\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_11e14776-9acf-42dd-83af-d3befb56f9a6.png\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">для кухни &nbsp;</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_3245cabe-cb4d-4377-a042-aed2c64c70f0.png\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Для гостиной</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_701e8762-f5ad-42e7-867c-1e2c3efc1dea.png\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Для ванной комнаты</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_cd281a35-e93a-4ef3-84fc-f997c0abc05e.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Для использования на улице</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_8dc304bf-a07f-4608-8c5b-ab917085b63d.png\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">И многое другое</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_dc2859f4-e17a-4ad5-b732-9ad3080ec174.png\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Мрамор</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Мрамор можно добыть в пещерах на уровнях от 32 до -32</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_fe3255b4-6255-4d48-b4f9-a5ff252e636f.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_11d54a81-4e0c-40c5-99a3-eca7f1030a33.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"119\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_83b64973-b153-4d88-b1fe-95edbab08bb9.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"118\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_9bfe5855-87d2-4735-9d08-a36cced51cd4.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"119\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Цвета древесины</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_34133119-eccb-43f2-a7c3-b0a3e493c8d6.png\" width=\"213\" height=\"102\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_edc3feaa-7650-4512-9463-5ab62deb07bc.png\" width=\"216\" height=\"103\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_2a447ef4-858b-480c-9b2e-de0b217c3a66.png\" width=\"216\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Работает со всеми доступными цветами</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Горшки для цветов</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_e1a6ad5f-524d-48ca-861c-f4be826b9139.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"94\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_bd6de7df-69de-4dba-8e6b-ce1a1f09a441.png\" width=\"197\" height=\"94\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_c5e9f11d-0d1c-40f4-b348-5cbd5568a218.png\" width=\"196\" height=\"93\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Все варианты доступны в горшках из белого и черного мрамора</p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Освещение</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_c27efec2-5d4c-401f-a4e5-04de52e74d77.png\" width=\"211\" height=\"98\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_824eb254-49ab-4038-8780-ac6373423d86.png\" width=\"204\" height=\"97\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_49a1af75-a84d-4493-a81b-a52637958e9f.png\" width=\"197\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_ad1bbf95-3963-4f80-9a5f-3d236e653f55.png\" width=\"221\" height=\"102\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_cc1eaae4-bc8e-48f2-96f1-5058060dc416.png\" width=\"224\" height=\"104\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_40a37b4c-d0c6-407e-aab4-f3ac8bbd55cb.png\" width=\"216\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\">Декор интерьера</pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_753ef828-8fda-4047-bacd-a8bb152b643a.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"143\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_587500d8-5d68-49c3-943b-5c1991024176.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_f1ec18bf-8441-491e-a67c-45cc76730d84.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"145\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_5e005b76-8d2f-4310-88b4-38b0b18031c8.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_3c45fe47-2f6a-4ce2-8df2-84bfa46e2ecd.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"141\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_7a05d353-1c1e-4100-aa9f-486597cb07b0.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_c18f8705-75f8-4b39-a23a-e7b731243a03.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"138\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_ec8f157d-6f2a-4b0d-b6c5-a7c5cca1b2e5.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_427dca0c-6dba-4279-b716-fc55a4ac77b6.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"135\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_048b8e29-58f6-455a-85fd-a4c0bc6e28e3.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"139\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_3fa58b08-69b3-43e2-a1e4-39e0baab03bd.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"134\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_655f599f-26b3-4fa7-b554-8af4becbedb5.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_1e475678-02ec-47b9-bb71-ccecd5f56b23.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"137\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_82910427-21d1-4cd7-98a6-8674f4b8008a.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"143\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_a0eb01b6-9306-4372-82ca-4129436603a7.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"142\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_bb0b1957-69b3-4e4a-949d-1ef42a8b3d7e.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"139\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/549319/description_86905968-989b-43b2-b167-ce33c8f128f8.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"139\"></p>\n<h3>VanillaDeco</h3>\n<h4>1.21.1🟩1.20.6🟩1.20.4🟩1.20.1🟩1.19.4🟩1.19.2🟩1.18.2🟩1.18🟩1.17.1🟩1.16.5🟩1.15.2🟥1.14.4🟩</h4>\n<h4>1.13🟥1.12.2🟥1.11🟥1.10.2🟥1.9.2🟥1.8🟥1.7.10🟥1.6.4🟥1.6.2🟥1.5.2🟥1.4.7🟥1.3🟥1.2.5🟥1.1🟥</h4>\n<h3>Jammy Furniture Reborn (требуется установка Gollum-Core-Lib)</h3>\n<h4>1.21.1🟥1.20.6🟥1.20.4🟥1.20.1🟥1.19.4🟥1.19.2🟥1.18.2🟥1.18🟥1.17.1🟥1.16.5🟥1.15.2🟥1.14.4🟥</h4>\n<h4>1.13🟥1.12.2🟥1.11🟥1.10.2🟥1.9.2🟥1.8🟩1.7.10🟩1.6.4🟩1.6.2🟩1.5.2🟥1.4.7🟥1.3🟥1.2.5🟥1.1🟥</h4>\n<h4>Jammy Furniture OG</h4>\n<h4>1.21.1🟥1.20.6🟥1.20.4🟥1.20.1🟥1.19.4🟥1.19.2🟥1.18.2🟥1.18🟥1.17.1🟥1.16.5🟥1.15.2🟥1.14.4🟥</h4>\n<h4>1.13🟥1.12.2🟥1.11🟥1.10.2🟥1.9.2🟥1.8🟥1.7.10🟥1.6.4🟥1.6.2🟥1.5.2🟩1.4.7🟩1.3🟩1.2.5🟩1.1🟩</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Звуки блоков вдохновлены несколькими старыми модами, такими как Jammy Supply, Extended Deco, а также текстурпаком, созданным gussdx для этих серий&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
